# Learn more https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files

# dependencies
node_modules/

# Expo
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts

# Native
.kotlin/
*.orig.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision

# Metro
.metro-health-check*

# debug
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*

# macOS
.DS_Store
*.pem
# 자체 OTA 공개 인증서만 커밋한다(ota-self-host.md 6절, B6 준비 리뷰 M2). 개인키 이름(private-key.pem·*.private.pem)은 위 *.pem과 루트 .gitignore가 막는다
!certs/ota-preview.pem
!certs/ota-production.pem

# local env files
.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android

# Skia 웹 CanvasKit (pnpm web 때 setup-skia-web이 복사)
public/canvaskit.wasm

# @bacons/apple-targets가 prebuild 때 expo-target.config.js colors로 만드는 색 자산(파생물)
targets/*/Assets.xcassets/
